<meta name="description" content="The IEEE Sensors Council proudly presents the fourth edition of the IEEE Applied Sensing Conference (APSCON 2026), taking place at IIT Delhi from February 23rd to 25th, 2026. This premier event invites scientists, engineers, and industry leaders from around the world to connect, share groundbreaking research in sensing technologies, and explore the latest advancements shaping the field. ">
